    "semantics": "The adapter validates the exact pinned graph and constants, reproduces the MIL int32-to-int16 token cast and negative-token wrap before gather, evaluates two forward LSTMs with IFOC gate order and [4H,input]/[4H,H] weight orientation, preserves fp16 MIL cast boundaries, returns fp32 outputs, and accepts returned GPU state arrays directly on the next transition."
